<ProjectLayout slug="a-parable-of-proximity">
  <p>
    <em>A Parable of Proximity</em> explores the tension between
    closeness and distance, examining how physical proximity does
    not necessarily produce understanding or intimacy.
  </p>

  <p>
    Through shifting relationships between figures, objects and
    space, the work considers the unstable boundaries that emerge
    when separate bodies attempt to approach, observe or respond to
    one another.
  </p>

